SUMMARY:HOT Topics in Analysis
DESCRIPTION:To mark the occasion of the birthday and retirement of Hans-Olav Tylli\, we are pleased to announce the conference HOT Topics in Analysis . The meeting takes place 26-27 November 2026 at the University of Helsinki. The themes of the conference are Banach space theory\, operator theory\, complex analysis and related topics. Speakers Kari Astala (University of Helsinki) Isabelle Chalendar (Université G\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16258/
